Seeker: No, we just teleported.

04:53:27.830 --> 04:53:28.870
DM: You used it to teleport.

04:53:28.870 --> 04:53:28.970
Unknown: We just teleported.

04:53:29.070 --> 04:53:29.770
DM: Yeah.

04:53:29.830 --> 04:53:30.850
Unknown: Yeah.

04:53:30.850 --> 04:53:32.530
DM: So that doesn't work, unfortunately.

04:53:34.530 --> 04:53:34.870
Unknown: Ah.

04:53:38.990 --> 04:53:40.550
Seeker: No Delwath Prime. Sorry, buddy.

04:53:41.210 --> 04:53:41.870
Unknown: That's all right.

