Wellby: It's awesome.

04:54:11.910 --> 04:54:12.510
DM: So close.

04:54:12.890 --> 04:54:13.470
Unknown: It does. It's so good.

04:54:13.470 --> 04:54:16.290
DM: Keep it in mind for another time, maybe for the Apollyon fight.

04:54:18.190 --> 04:54:18.390
Unknown: Right.

04:54:18.390 --> 04:54:18.530
DM: Or-

04:54:19.290 --> 04:54:19.950
Seeker: The thing is,

04:54:21.570 --> 04:54:22.890
Seeker: do one that wander around the ship.

04:54:22.890 --> 04:54:24.670
Seeker: The simulacrum can just hang out.

04:54:25.150 --> 04:54:25.630
Unknown: Yeah.

04:54:25.650 --> 04:54:25.990
Unknown: It doesn't like-

04:54:26.050 --> 04:54:27.710
DM: Right. But it doesn't heal, so it...

04:54:27.710 --> 04:54:32.970
