Delwath: I can long rest in four hours, right?

05:01:14.946 --> 05:01:15.126
DM: Yeah.

05:01:15.806 --> 05:01:20.366
Delwath: So in-- I'm gonna long rest, wake up, cast Aid, and then short rest.

05:01:22.286 --> 05:01:22.586
DM: Okay.

05:01:23.886 --> 05:01:24.166
DM: Um-

05:01:24.426 --> 05:01:25.526
Unknown: So we get the bonus hit points.

05:01:26.786 --> 05:01:28.166
Unknown: Which I completely understand.

05:01:28.166 --> 05:01:28.366
Unknown: So,

05:01:32.006 --> 05:01:32.866
Unknown: Cha'mutte dies.

05:01:34.586 --> 05:01:37.006
Unknown: Rai teleports to Dranikor.

05:01:37.646 --> 05:01:40.506
Kenzo: There's a dra- there's a dagger flying towards the tomb.

05:01:40.506 --> 05:01:41.906
Kenzo: Catches the dagger.

05:01:41.906 --> 05:01:44.446
Kenzo: Stands there for like a few decades, and then is like, "What?

05:01:45.926 --> 05:01:47.886
Unknown: Is that what he decided to do?" He goes to the temple.

05:01:47.926 --> 05:01:48.686
DM: He goes to the temple.

05:01:48.686 --> 05:01:48.906
Unknown: To the temple.

05:01:49.466 --> 05:01:53.666
DM: Apollyon keeps getting weaker every year that he's disconnected from his phylactery.

05:01:53.826 --> 05:01:53.946
Unknown: Yeah.

05:01:54.798 --> 05:01:59.518
DM: So Rai feels that Apollyon has gotten so weak that he doesn't have to stand guard anymore,

05:02:00.598 --> 05:02:01.498
DM: goes to the temple

05:02:01.698 --> 05:02:02.258
Unknown: Which temple?

05:02:02.258 --> 05:02:04.258
DM: The Temple of the Eight Divines in Dranikor.

05:02:04.638 --> 05:02:04.958
Unknown: Ah, okay.

05:02:04.958 --> 05:02:08.138
DM: Which is the only place that isn't full of the-

05:02:08.178 --> 05:02:08.438
Unknown: The red plague

05:02:08.438 --> 05:02:09.158
DM: ... plague death.

05:02:09.238 --> 05:02:09.438
Unknown: Okay.

05:02:11.038 --> 05:02:11.538
DM: Waits.

05:02:12.498 --> 05:02:17.778
DM: Sh- Apollyon's getting weaker, but this Limbo chaos that Cha'mut has used to

05:02:19.518 --> 05:02:20.198
DM: imprison,

05:02:21.538 --> 05:02:29.218
DM: the f- the fragments of Limbo that Cha'mut has used to imprison Apollyon are growing stronger, and they're connect- They're like...

05:02:29.218 --> 05:02:33.558
DM: There's like a net of Limbo stretching out across the world that Rai is getting worried about.

05:02:33.858 --> 05:02:34.038
Unknown: Mm.

05:02:36.838 --> 05:02:38.238
Unknown: And then what he does?

05:02:38.818 --> 05:02:40.198
DM: Then he decides he needs...

05:02:40.198 --> 05:02:43.978
DM: The vision ends with him, like, putting the dagger in the temple and

05:02:45.118 --> 05:02:47.738
DM: deciding to go do something about the

05:02:49.458 --> 05:02:50.378
DM: Limbo chaos.

05:02:51.478 --> 05:02:54.138
Unknown: Wait, but doesn't... So what does his hand get pulled to bits?

05:02:54.198 --> 05:02:59.158
DM: Presumably he fails to do something about the Limbo chaos, and his hand explodes into bits.

05:02:59.338 --> 05:02:59.738
Unknown: Yeah, we... No, but we knew that, right?

05:02:59.778 --> 05:03:00.458
DM: You knew that, yeah.

05:03:00.498 --> 05:03:00.878
Unknown: We saw the b-

05:03:01.538 --> 05:03:01.578
Unknown: Yeah.

