05:03:07.018 --> 05:03:09.618
Seeker: So bit, that probably happened in Isengard.

05:03:10.178 --> 05:03:10.438
DM: Yeah.

05:03:11.538 --> 05:03:12.818
Seeker: And he's, throughout this time,

05:03:14.098 --> 05:03:14.658
Seeker: he's jade.

05:03:15.058 --> 05:03:15.358
DM: Yeah.

05:03:15.398 --> 05:03:17.118
