Unknown: Do we?

05:03:21.818 --> 05:03:23.298
Seeker: Yeah, where is the rest of him?

05:03:23.298 --> 05:03:24.038
Seeker: Must be in Isengard.

05:03:24.078 --> 05:03:25.458
Unknown: In Isengard. Mm-hmm.

05:03:25.458 --> 05:03:27.178
