05:03:27.458 --> 05:03:27.658
DM: Yeah.

05:03:29.738 --> 05:03:32.198
Seeker: But the dagger is in this temple in Dranikor.

05:03:32.198 --> 05:03:33.078
Unknown: Well, unless it moved.

05:03:34.058 --> 05:03:35.158
Unknown: But it's a good starting spot.

05:03:35.898 --> 05:03:36.938
DM: It's a good starting spot.

05:03:37.398 --> 05:03:38.238
Unknown: Oh, we could help with there.

05:03:40.278 --> 05:03:41.358
Seeker: Having seen it.

05:03:41.638 --> 05:03:42.638
DM: Could.

05:03:42.638 --> 05:03:43.958
Seeker: We could try anyway.

05:03:45.018 --> 05:03:45.578
Unknown: Worth a lot.

05:03:48.418 --> 05:03:48.938
Unknown: All right, cool.

05:03:52.438 --> 05:03:53.918
Seeker: Sort of raises the question, do we...

05:03:55.858 --> 05:03:56.058
Unknown: Wait,

