Kenzo: It's your opportunity to be free.

05:27:20.404 --> 05:27:21.624
Kenzo: The island will be yours.

05:27:22.124 --> 05:27:22.904
Unknown: By, by, by laying low the dragon.

05:27:22.904 --> 05:27:25.324
Unknown: And we pull out some examples, like this is the kind of shiny thing you can get.

05:27:25.664 --> 05:27:28.344
