05:27:28.364 --> 05:27:29.264
Unknown: We're not messing around. [laughs]

05:27:29.284 --> 05:27:31.244
Delwath: We have to see them in the sky in the battle.

05:27:31.244 --> 05:27:32.424
Delwath: They can't just like fly.

05:27:32.484 --> 05:27:32.804
Unknown: Yeah.

05:27:32.804 --> 05:27:34.004
Delwath: But they don't have to fight the dragon.

05:27:34.004 --> 05:27:34.864
Kenzo: They do not have to fight the dragon.

05:27:34.884 --> 05:27:36.284
Delwath: They only have to fight other dragonets.

05:27:36.484 --> 05:27:37.344
Wellby: Yep, yep.

05:27:37.344 --> 05:27:38.084
Unknown: Right? They can-

05:27:38.104 --> 05:27:40.064
Kenzo: But tonight, but tonight is the last night-

05:27:40.144 --> 05:27:40.284
Unknown: Right

05:27:40.284 --> 05:27:41.484
Kenzo: ... of Raghemldros' rule.

05:27:41.524 --> 05:27:43.044
Delwath: Yeah. That's actually, we should put this in the scrolls too.

05:27:43.044 --> 05:27:47.344
Delwath: The deal I think we should make with the dragonets is any dragonet who shows up in the battle

05:27:48.624 --> 05:27:53.744
Delwath: who fights other dragonets, they can run away as soon as there are no-

05:27:53.804 --> 05:27:53.944
Wellby: Yeah

05:27:53.944 --> 05:27:57.524
