05:27:58.104 --> 05:27:58.584
Wellby: Good.

05:27:58.604 --> 05:28:01.704
Delwath: Right? But they have to show up and fight in the sky.

05:28:01.704 --> 05:28:02.324
Unknown: We have to see them.

05:28:02.464 --> 05:28:02.964
Wellby: Okay.

05:28:02.964 --> 05:28:05.244
Delwath: And if they, they do that, they get something from the hoard.

05:28:06.444 --> 05:28:11.304
Kenzo: And they get to be part of this, this future without Raghemldros.

05:28:11.784 --> 05:28:12.064
Unknown: Right.

05:28:12.904 --> 05:28:13.644
Delwath: We'll tell them to. I mean-

05:28:13.704 --> 05:28:13.904
Wellby: All right

05:28:13.904 --> 05:28:15.204
Unknown: ... be interesting to see how do they react.

05:28:15.844 --> 05:28:16.764
DM: Um,

05:28:18.044 --> 05:28:19.944
DM: make an insight check. Or Kenzo.

05:28:20.624 --> 05:28:23.924
DM: Kenzo's the insider. Or Well- do you have insight, Wellby?

05:28:23.964 --> 05:28:25.084
