05:28:25.084 --> 05:28:25.944
DM: Okay. Both of you can make an insight check.

05:28:26.004 --> 05:28:28.764
Kenzo: I have extremely good. 20 something, 25 I think.

05:28:28.764 --> 05:28:30.264
Wellby: Uh, 23 for me.

05:28:30.264 --> 05:28:31.144
DM: Yeah. They're...

05:28:32.564 --> 05:28:33.164
Kenzo: 25, I think.

05:28:33.164 --> 05:28:35.644
DM: They're, uh, they're definitely curious.

05:28:35.664 --> 05:28:36.424
DM: I mean...

05:28:36.444 --> 05:28:38.264
Unknown: Just tell your friends

05:28:38.264 --> 05:28:43.644
DM: ... they're, they're trying not to let on anything, but they're kind of like, "Um, okay."

05:28:46.784 --> 05:28:48.984
