05:28:51.824 --> 05:28:54.464
Delwath: I mean, we should climb up to the tower at some point, right?

05:28:55.244 --> 05:28:55.284
DM: Um-

05:28:55.384 --> 05:28:56.544
Seeker: How, how am I gonna...

05:28:57.764 --> 05:28:58.884
Seeker: If I'm gonna fully prep,

05:29:00.004 --> 05:29:01.544
Seeker: I will activate the ladder.

05:29:02.684 --> 05:29:04.524
Delwath: It, it's hard to know.

