05:29:14.264 --> 05:29:16.964
Seeker: Yeah. But the construct isn't able to fly, does it?

05:29:17.024 --> 05:29:19.744
DM: So, right, maybe you pick something else.

05:29:20.184 --> 05:29:21.124
Unknown: Yeah. Well.

05:29:21.584 --> 05:29:21.764
DM: Yeah.

05:29:23.684 --> 05:29:23.984
Unknown: Um,

05:29:25.304 --> 05:29:26.644
Delwath: I mean, it would be nice if we could...

05:29:26.644 --> 05:29:28.564
Delwath: Is there any way we can think of to get...

