05:30:11.644 --> 05:30:12.204
DM: I mean,

05:30:13.744 --> 05:30:14.604
DM: there used to be

05:30:16.424 --> 05:30:17.604
DM: something in the center,

05:30:19.044 --> 05:30:22.404
DM: some sort of crystal that generated light, I think.

05:30:22.404 --> 05:30:24.404
Unknown: Like you climb up there, you poke around.

05:30:24.724 --> 05:30:24.904
DM: I don't-

05:30:24.904 --> 05:30:26.264
Delwath: We just try putting a driftglobe in and see what happens

05:30:26.264 --> 05:30:30.924
DM: ... flies so well anymore, but there's like a, it's like hollow in the middle.

05:30:31.964 --> 05:30:33.224
DM: Some of the crystals are broken.

05:30:33.224 --> 05:30:36.504
DM: I think it used to ha- you know, shine precisely.

05:30:37.044 --> 05:30:38.104
Seeker: Precisely where?

05:30:38.124 --> 05:30:38.604
DM: I don't know.

05:30:39.024 --> 05:30:40.184
Delwath: Let's go investigate it.

05:30:40.264 --> 05:30:40.584
Unknown: Yeah.

05:30:40.644 --> 05:30:41.044
Wellby: Yeah.

05:30:41.044 --> 05:30:42.204
