05:30:43.164 --> 05:30:43.384
DM: Yeah.

05:30:44.624 --> 05:30:45.644
DM: So you climb up.

05:30:45.724 --> 05:30:46.204
Unknown: Yeah. Mm-hmm.

05:30:46.264 --> 05:30:51.524
DM: And so it's, it's, it's eight faceted, and like Seeker is pretty good at this sort of stuff.

05:30:51.524 --> 05:31:01.664
DM: You'd think the way it would've normally worked is like it could have shined along the paths of the pilgrim roads, and it would

05:31:01.664 --> 05:31:07.224
DM: splinter the light so it would shine across the, all the pilgrim roads at night so that they would have-

05:31:07.284 --> 05:31:08.104
Seeker: To light their way.

05:31:08.104 --> 05:31:08.344
DM: Yeah. Right.

05:31:08.344 --> 05:31:09.224
Wellby: That's really cool.

05:31:09.924 --> 05:31:16.404
DM: But two of the, two of the facets are broken, and there's clearly, like there's clearly supposed to be something big in the middle.

05:31:16.584 --> 05:31:18.724
Seeker: So it'd be much more powerful in a dr- driftglobe.

05:31:18.724 --> 05:31:18.924
Unknown: But...

05:31:19.964 --> 05:31:21.564
DM: Well, maybe not in daylight.

05:31:21.564 --> 05:31:22.984
DM: Definitely way more powerful than a lantern.

05:31:23.004 --> 05:31:24.224
Delwath: But daylight lasts for an hour.

05:31:24.444 --> 05:31:26.564
Wellby: Lasts for an hour, and we have two driftglobes.

05:31:26.564 --> 05:31:28.564
Wellby: We can do two dope.

05:31:28.564 --> 05:31:34.424
Delwath: But, but before we do any, like can Seeker futz about and see if you, see if it would even...

05:31:34.424 --> 05:31:39.084
Delwath: Before we trigger daylight, just use the regular light and it, does it, does it, is it weak, right?

05:31:39.084 --> 05:31:40.224
Unknown: Does it do anything?

05:31:40.284 --> 05:31:40.904
Unknown: Oh, let's-

05:31:40.984 --> 05:31:43.284
Wellby: I think we don't want to turn it on because as soon as we turn it on-

05:31:43.304 --> 05:31:44.864
