05:31:44.864 --> 05:31:45.304
Unknown: [laughs]

05:31:45.384 --> 05:31:45.964
Delwath: Oh, that's true. Well-

05:31:45.984 --> 05:31:47.824
Seeker: But didn't we tell them where to meet us anyway?

05:31:47.884 --> 05:31:48.244
Unknown: True.

05:31:49.184 --> 05:31:49.504
Unknown: Yeah.

05:31:50.584 --> 05:31:50.884
Unknown: Why do-

05:31:51.304 --> 05:31:57.644
Wellby: Can you figure out... So it, it shines in these like spotlights, but will it give ambient light around the top of the tower?

05:31:58.484 --> 05:32:00.604
DM: I mean, the, the, the way that-

05:32:00.604 --> 05:32:00.804
Unknown: That's a good question

05:32:00.804 --> 05:32:01.884
DM: ... the way that you imagine it-

05:32:01.884 --> 05:32:03.004
Seeker: We could set it up a different way than it was before

05:32:03.004 --> 05:32:07.884
DM: ... well, the way you imagine it would've worked is the whole top of the mountain would be glowing with light.

05:32:07.904 --> 05:32:08.184
Unknown: And the beams would come down. Cut

05:32:08.184 --> 05:32:10.224
DM: And then there would be beams coming down.

05:32:11.004 --> 05:32:12.524
DM: Now, it's cracked.

05:32:13.324 --> 05:32:23.544
DM: Two of the panels are broken entirely and definitely could not be repaired, and a third panel is like shifted out of place and is misaligned.

05:32:25.004 --> 05:32:27.364
Delwath: I mean, if we could just get enough light to give us...

05:32:27.364 --> 05:32:36.316
