05:32:36.316 --> 05:32:37.816
Delwath: Like there's a bunch of stuff you can do to prep.

05:32:38.196 --> 05:32:38.716
Seeker: Mm-hmm.

05:32:38.716 --> 05:32:39.756
Delwath: Cast Fly, cast-

05:32:39.836 --> 05:32:41.136
Seeker: Oh, so the light might actually help see her-

05:32:41.476 --> 05:32:41.536
Unknown: Yeah

05:32:41.536 --> 05:32:42.176
Kenzo: ... from longer range.

05:32:42.196 --> 05:32:42.236
Unknown: Yeah.

05:32:42.236 --> 05:32:44.756
Wellby: I can also start shooting at 270 feet now.

05:32:45.336 --> 05:32:45.876
Seeker: Oh, that's nice. Wow.

05:32:45.876 --> 05:32:47.436
Wellby: Which is a long way.

05:32:47.876 --> 05:32:48.056
Unknown: That is.

05:32:48.096 --> 05:32:49.796
Seeker: So can I use Mending on the broken part?

05:32:51.496 --> 05:32:51.876
Unknown: Um,

05:32:54.476 --> 05:32:55.816
DM: so you could... Mending?

05:32:55.816 --> 05:32:58.656
DM: Yes. The ones that are like shattered, there's too much-

05:32:59.336 --> 05:32:59.456
Unknown: Mm

05:32:59.456 --> 05:33:01.176
Unknown: ... material missing.

05:33:01.176 --> 05:33:05.556
DM: But the one that's just like cracked out of place you could fix with Mending, yeah.

05:33:05.596 --> 05:33:07.916
Seeker: And then I suppose I could Performance of Creation like

05:33:09.256 --> 05:33:10.796
Seeker: missing crystal chunks.

05:33:11.116 --> 05:33:12.036
Unknown: Yeah. Why not?

05:33:12.676 --> 05:33:14.836
Seeker: That would ruin my Performance of Creation.

05:33:16.376 --> 05:33:19.376
Seeker: I don't usually need that for anything else w- when I'm animating the ladder.

05:33:19.416 --> 05:33:20.576
DM: And you can do two things, right?

05:33:20.876 --> 05:33:22.796
Unknown: So two, two chunks.

05:33:22.876 --> 05:33:23.436
Unknown: Two chunks.

05:33:24.396 --> 05:33:24.996
Seeker: It's probably worth doing.

05:33:25.036 --> 05:33:26.256
Delwath: I mean, you took the craft feat.

05:33:26.256 --> 05:33:27.456
Delwath: You may as well craft something.

05:33:27.496 --> 05:33:28.196
Unknown: Yeah, yeah, yeah. All right.

05:33:28.196 --> 05:33:29.856
Unknown: You paid 60 gold. [laughs]

05:33:29.896 --> 05:33:31.296
Unknown: I will set about fully repairing.

05:33:31.836 --> 05:33:32.216
Unknown: Hell yeah.

05:33:32.896 --> 05:33:33.356
Unknown: I like it.

05:33:33.676 --> 05:33:34.356
DM: Let's go.

05:33:35.255 --> 05:33:36.115
Unknown: Awesome.

05:33:36.115 --> 05:33:38.056
Delwath: And yeah, we have daylight to power it, right?

05:33:38.136 --> 05:33:42.936
