Wellby: You'll need it during that very fight.

05:33:50.496 --> 05:33:53.096
Unknown: One way or other, this'll be over in five hours.

05:33:53.096 --> 05:33:53.456
Unknown: That's true.

05:33:53.456 --> 05:33:53.556
Unknown: Probably.

05:33:53.556 --> 05:33:54.716
Delwath: Or it'll also be dawn and then we won't need it. [laughs]

05:33:54.736 --> 05:33:55.256
Unknown: Or it'll be dawn.

05:33:55.596 --> 05:33:55.976
Unknown: It'll be light out.

05:33:56.016 --> 05:33:57.656
DM: It's gonna be dawn in two hours.

05:33:57.716 --> 05:33:58.076
Unknown: Yeah.

05:33:58.156 --> 05:34:05.016
DM: Uh, you probably have... Now with Seeker's tinker, you probably have half an hour before like the expectation of when she'd arrive.

05:34:05.016 --> 05:34:05.496
DM: But I was like,

05:34:06.836 --> 05:34:07.776
DM: "So what's the plan?

05:34:09.896 --> 05:34:11.956
DM: I mean, I know we're not big on plans, right?

05:34:11.956 --> 05:34:12.636
Unknown: But..."

