Delwath: How long does it last?

05:34:20.416 --> 05:34:20.956
Unknown: An hour.

05:34:22.036 --> 05:34:23.896
Delwath: Good enough. Uh, and can Tilly fly?

05:34:24.616 --> 05:34:24.816
Unknown: Yeah.

