Unknown: But

05:34:27.916 --> 05:34:29.096
DM: he looks at Delwath.

05:34:32.916 --> 05:34:33.716
DM: Do you have a bow?

05:34:36.396 --> 05:34:37.456
Unknown: No.

05:34:37.456 --> 05:34:39.056
DM: I'm not one to, you know,

05:34:40.176 --> 05:34:41.276
DM: hide from a fight,

05:34:43.036 --> 05:34:48.136
DM: but maybe it would make more sense for me to shoot arrows from cover.

05:34:48.956 --> 05:34:49.196
Unknown: Sure.

05:34:49.956 --> 05:34:50.976
Unknown: If you want to fly.

05:34:51.156 --> 05:34:51.476
Unknown: Oh, hey.

05:34:51.496 --> 05:34:52.716
Wellby: You have an extra bow, shortbow.

05:34:52.736 --> 05:34:53.936
Unknown: I'll, I'll take that trade.

05:34:54.896 --> 05:34:55.416
Unknown: You have a, you have a bow.

05:34:55.436 --> 05:34:56.456
Unknown: No, he has a bow.

