Wellby: Uh, I have arrows I can give you.

05:35:08.096 --> 05:35:09.356
DM: I, I'd take some arrows.

05:35:11.256 --> 05:35:12.916
Unknown: I mean, uh, yeah.

05:35:12.916 --> 05:35:14.816
Delwath: I think th- I think that's a good trade.

