Wellby: I'm gonna give him 20 of the honed accurate scare arrows so he also does not have disadvantage at long range.

05:35:22.776 --> 05:35:23.096
Unknown: Okay.

05:35:24.496 --> 05:35:25.156
Wellby: Anyone want ice cream?

