Unknown: What's that?

05:35:33.236 --> 05:35:34.396
Delwath: I have a potion of heroism.

05:35:36.176 --> 05:35:38.716
Delwath: It blasts. It's 1D4 to every attack roll.

05:35:39.716 --> 05:35:40.976
DM: Tilly says...

