Delwath: Who's that gonna be most useful for?

05:35:42.356 --> 05:35:43.576
Unknown: I mean, I've...

05:35:45.196 --> 05:35:46.536
DM: When the dragon comes-

05:35:47.416 --> 05:35:47.676
Unknown: I like Kenzo

