08:15:40.606 --> 08:15:41.626
Unknown: I say just work on it. Keep working, keep working on it.

08:15:41.626 --> 08:15:41.746
Unknown: Yeah.

08:15:41.746 --> 08:15:42.946
Kenzo: Keep working on it. You'll, you'll get it.

08:15:42.946 --> 08:15:43.306
Unknown: You'll get it.

